    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PG19 外键批处理缺陷让约束被误标为已验证",
      "summary": "Amit Langote 为 PostgreSQL 19 的外键快速路径批处理提交三个修订补丁，起因是 Noah Misch 批评此前把批处理限制在顶层事务。0001 移除该限制，改用子事务标记跟踪缓存条目。0002 修一处数据损坏：PL/pgSQL 的 EXCEPTION 块捕获外键检查错误后 firing_depth 未递减，同一事务里后续的 ALTER TABLE ... ADD FOREIGN KEY 会在有违规行时静默通过。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CA+HiwqGHa3tc6MZFSLyLrvwySdrmpkb1TqkH2jGd3HtKGGZ6cQ@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Amit Langote",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-09",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "外键",
        "数据损坏",
        "PG19"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "整库 VACUUM 的权限检查修复接近提交",
      "summary": "全库 VACUUM 遇到并发删表的修复补丁走到 v8，关键是防止无特权用户对无权访问的关系申请 AccessExclusiveLock。缺少权限检查时，普通用户执行 VACUUM FULL 就能把强锁请求排进队列，阻塞所有新连接。Bharath Rupireddy 指出在 get_all_vacuum_rels() 的 ACL 检查里改用 _ext() 变体可以避开回归。Nathan Bossart 确认数日内提交。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CALj2ACWNu-Jw12GeYrrtnYHtEEt1OTA0+iJc92BWCtMmp_MBbQ@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Bharath Rupireddy",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-09",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "VACUUM",
        "权限",
        "锁"
      ],
      "position": 2
